1
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:20,999
I offer millions of thanks for this opportunity I have received to come and give testimony at the altar where the Holy Mother of Kreupasanam appeared alive,

2
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:29,999
My name is Martin Thomas. I come from Wayanad, from the Immaculate Heart Church parish.

3
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:36,999
It was in 13/05/2025 that I first took the Covenant.

4
00:00:37,000 --> 00:00:48,999
I am standing here to talk about the blessings I received after taking the Covenant.

5
00:00:49,000 --> 00:01:00,999
I renewed this Covenant in the past 21/03/2026. When I renewed it, my brother-in-law Joseph had a fatal disease,

6
00:01:01,000 --> 00:01:06,999
and I had placed that too as a prayer intention.

7
00:01:07,000 --> 00:01:13,999
Regarding that disease, and the miraculous healing he received from it,

8
00:01:14,000 --> 00:01:24,999
my brother-in-law Joseph lives in Bangalore, and Joseph himself will speak to you about that miraculous healing.

9
00:01:25,000 --> 00:01:38,999
Standing on this holy ground where my Holy Mother appeared alive, I give millions of thanks to the Mother and the Mother's Son for blessing me to give this testimony.

10
00:01:39,000 --> 00:01:46,999
My name is Joseph TD. I come from Carmelaram Mount Carmel Forane Church in Bangalore.

11
00:01:47,000 --> 00:01:50,999
This is my wife's younger brother, Martin Thomas.

12
00:01:51,000 --> 00:01:57,999
This month, this year, on April 16th, when my blood was tested,

13
00:01:58,000 --> 00:02:05,999
the test report came back positive, showing that I had contracted both Dengue and Typhoid together.

14
00:02:06,000 --> 00:02:15,999
Then my doctor told me, 'Let us treat the Dengue first, and once that is cured, we can treat the Typhoid.'

15
00:02:16,000 --> 00:02:22,999
So, when my blood was tested for Dengue, in the first test my hemoglobin was eight.

16
00:02:23,000 --> 00:02:32,999
When tested a second time, it became 7.5. The third time, it became 7. The fourth time, it became 6.8.

17
00:02:33,000 --> 00:02:41,999
By then, the Dengue became negative, and after that, the Typhoid also became negative. But my family doctor didn't tell me this;

18
00:02:42,000 --> 00:02:55,999
he told my son, 'Your Daddy's blood has 65 percent bad cells. Therefore, we must do a detailed examination.

19
00:02:56,000 --> 00:03:00,999
So, you should go to St. John's Medical Hospital in Bangalore.'

20
00:03:01,000 --> 00:03:08,999
He also introduced us to a professor he knew. We went there and got admitted.

21
00:03:09,000 --> 00:03:16,999
When they conducted all the tests, they found I had an illness called AML, which is a type of blood cancer.

22
00:03:17,000 --> 00:03:26,999
This isn't measured in stages; it has three types: Type One, Type Two, and Type Three.

23
00:03:27,000 --> 00:03:33,999
Type One can be treated and cured quickly. Type Two takes longer to treat, but it will be cured.

24
00:03:34,000 --> 00:03:43,999
But if it is Type Three, no treatment will work on it. So they decided to start giving me medicine.

25
00:03:44,000 --> 00:03:51,999
They said I had to do seven cycles. In one cycle, there are seven injections and 28 pills.

26
00:03:52,000 --> 00:03:58,999
So they said we could start the first month's treatment.

27
00:03:59,000 --> 00:04:08,999
Before this, on Monday morning, my elder brother's son who is in Bangalore, and his friend, who is the Head of Neurology at the Medical College,

28
00:04:09,000 --> 00:04:16,999
both came to see me. He looked at my file and said, 'Oh, this is blood cancer.

29
00:04:17,000 --> 00:04:25,999
There is no treatment for this. Therefore, let us pray.' Like the retreat masters, he had a cross in his hand.

30
00:04:26,000 --> 00:04:32,999
He placed it, laid his hands on my head, and prayed for a good death. Then, as he was leaving, he told me, 'Don't tell them that I said this.

31
00:04:33,000 --> 00:04:38,999
They will come and explain everything to you themselves.' It was after that my doctor came and said,

32
00:04:39,000 --> 00:04:46,999
'Let us start the treatment today itself—seven injections and 28 pills.'

33
00:04:47,000 --> 00:04:52,999
So, when I learned that this was my condition, I called my parish priest.

34
00:04:53,000 --> 00:05:01,999
My first parish priest, who built our church in Bangalore, is now retired and is here in Palai. So I called him and said,

35
00:05:02,000 --> 00:05:07,999
'Father, this is my condition. I am admitted at St. John's. Therefore, if I die,

36
00:05:08,000 --> 00:05:18,999
you must come and conduct my funeral service. You must be the chief celebrant at my home, the church, and the cemetery, and conduct my funeral service.'

37
00:05:19,000 --> 00:05:26,999
Immediately, the priest told me, 'Son, but you will only die after living another 10 years! Even so, I will come and do everything.'

38
00:05:27,000 --> 00:05:35,999
After that, I called my brother-in-law. My brother-in-law asked me to send a photo of the medicine they were administering, and I sent that photo.

39
00:05:36,000 --> 00:05:41,999
When he did a lot of research on this disease, he realized that it is a highly fatal illness.

40
00:05:42,000 --> 00:05:47,999
He asked when I would be discharged, and I said Thursday. By Thursday evening itself,

41
00:05:48,000 --> 00:05:56,999
my brother-in-law came to Bangalore. He came and told me, 'Let us go to Kreupasanam this Friday itself. I came specifically to take you there.'

42
00:05:57,000 --> 00:06:03,999
Then, my son said, 'Daddy, you've taken a lot of leave this month, haven't you? We can't take leave again this Friday.

43
00:06:04,000 --> 00:06:10,999
So, let's go next week or sometime later.' So I told my brother-in-law.

44
00:06:11,000 --> 00:06:17,999
As soon as my brother-in-law arrived to see me, he had brought the blessed oil from Kreupasanam.

45
00:06:18,000 --> 00:06:24,999
He anointed my forehead with it, gave me a drop to drink, and poured honey into my mouth. From that day on,

46
00:06:25,000 --> 00:06:31,999
I started consuming the blessed salt before meals, and continued doing all these things.

47
00:06:32,000 --> 00:06:36,999
So that's how it was. I told my brother-in-law that it wouldn't be possible this week, and told him to go back.

48
00:06:37,000 --> 00:06:44,999
We decided to come the following Friday, which was the 10th—the 10th of this month. We even booked a vehicle.

49
00:06:45,000 --> 00:06:50,999
Then my son came and said, 'Daddy, we can't go next Friday.' I immediately called my brother-in-law and said,

50
00:06:51,000 --> 00:06:58,999
'He says it's not possible this week either; let's go in May.' Then my brother-in-law said,

51
00:06:59,000 --> 00:07:03,999
'You are not understanding the seriousness of this.' I told him I would talk to him,

52
00:07:04,000 --> 00:07:09,999
hung up my phone, and then he spoke with my son for about four minutes.

53
00:07:10,000 --> 00:07:14,999
After speaking with him, my son came downstairs and said, "Daddy, let's go this coming Friday itself."

54
00:07:15,000 --> 00:07:19,999
We arrived here on the 10th, and by 7:00 PM that evening, we had joined the gathering here.

55
00:07:20,000 --> 00:07:26,999
As I entered this compound, I prayed to the Blessed Mother, "Mother, please make me a witness to your apparition."

56
00:07:27,000 --> 00:07:32,999
It was with this heartfelt prayer that I stepped into the compound, and I kept repeating it until the moment I left.

57
00:07:33,000 --> 00:07:40,999
I went to the place where the Blessed Mother appeared and prayed, and after that, we returned to our room.

58
00:07:41,000 --> 00:07:49,999
The next morning, we came here and devoutly participated in the Holy Mass, and following that, we took the Covenant.

59
00:07:50,000 --> 00:07:56,999
Initially, when taking the Covenant, there was no provision to meet the priest, but God granted me a blessing to see him.

60
00:07:57,000 --> 00:08:03,999
Father laid his hands on my head, prayed over me, anointed my forehead with Holy Oil, and gave me a blessed medal.

61
00:08:04,000 --> 00:08:11,999
We stayed right here until the evening, and when it was time to return to our upstairs room, I severely struggled to climb the stairs.

62
00:08:12,000 --> 00:08:18,999
I managed to climb up somehow, but when I woke up on Sunday morning, I felt a deep, miraculous sense of healing.

63
00:08:19,000 --> 00:08:26,999
I felt that all my illnesses were completely healed and I was entirely refreshed, so we joyfully went to the Arthunkal Church.

64
00:08:27,000 --> 00:08:33,999
We attended the morning Holy Mass and then traveled back to Bangalore, as I was scheduled to be admitted to the hospital.

65
00:08:34,000 --> 00:08:42,999
On Monday, we got admitted to St. John's Hospital, where the doctor initially told us that after three cycles of chemotherapy, they would perform a bone marrow test.

66
00:08:43,000 --> 00:08:48,999
However, as soon as I was admitted, the doctor suggested doing a bone marrow test immediately.

67
00:08:49,000 --> 00:08:55,999
He said we should test it first and then decide on the further course of treatment. Thus, the bone marrow sample was taken on Monday.

68
00:08:56,000 --> 00:09:02,999
Tuesday and Wednesday passed, and the medical staff didn't disclose any information to me. On Wednesday, my resident doctor came and said,

69
00:09:03,000 --> 00:09:07,999
"The reports have arrived, but we are not authorized to disclose them." He informed me that the consulting professor,

70
00:09:08,000 --> 00:09:13,999
would come and discuss the reports with me at 3:00 PM on Thursday.

71
00:09:14,000 --> 00:09:23,999
On Thursday at 3:00 PM, Dr. Chaitanya arrived and told me, "In my entire medical career, I have never seen a patient like this."

72
00:09:24,000 --> 00:09:28,999
He added, "After just one cycle, no patient in the world would show such a miraculous transformation in their blood."

73
00:09:29,000 --> 00:09:40,999
He explained, "You had 65 percent malignant cells, but now the report shows absolutely zero malignant cells in your blood."

74
00:09:41,000 --> 00:09:48,999
He said, "I cannot believe this report; how did this happen?" I then answered, "Doctor, we went to Kreupasanam on Friday,

75
00:09:49,000 --> 00:09:56,999
and on Saturday, we solemnly took the Covenant, and the priest there laid his hands on my head and prayed."

76
00:09:57,000 --> 00:10:02,999
Hearing this, the doctor declared, "This is a profound miracle; no one but God could cure this.

77
00:10:03,000 --> 00:10:09,999
This is a tremendous blessing that God has mercifully bestowed upon you."

78
00:10:10,000 --> 00:10:15,999
The doctor said it right then and there, "I can never believe this, this simply does not happen medically."

79
00:10:16,000 --> 00:10:21,999
He explained that only after three or four cycles would there be any noticeable reduction in the malignant cells in the blood.

80
00:10:22,000 --> 00:10:29,999
But here, after just one cycle, the Blessed Mother and her Divine Son completely healed me, leaving not a single malignant cell.

81
00:10:30,000 --> 00:10:36,999
The doctor didn't mention anything about the next stages of treatment because he was traveling to the UK and would only return on the 30th.

82
00:10:37,000 --> 00:10:44,999
As far as I was concerned, when I first started this medication, the doctor warned me that I would suffer from about seven severe side effects.

83
00:10:45,000 --> 00:10:50,999
However, I didn't experience a single side effect because I was continuously using all the items from Kreupasanam.

84
00:10:51,000 --> 00:10:55,999
I applied the Holy Oil, and I faithfully consumed the blessed honey and the blessed salt.

85
00:10:56,000 --> 00:11:01,999
Because of this divine protection, I suffered zero side effects, leaving the doctors themselves completely astounded.

86
00:11:02,000 --> 00:11:09,999
They wondered why I wasn't experiencing any side effects, and I offer a billion thanks for this complete healing granted by God and the Divine Son.

87
00:11:10,000 --> 00:11:17,999
Furthermore, during the four days I was admitted to the hospital, we had brought along many newsletters of the Kreupasanam.

88
00:11:18,000 --> 00:11:22,999
All of them were faithfully distributed in Bangalore by my brother-in-law, because I was confined to the hospital bed.

89
00:11:23,000 --> 00:11:31,999
So, I firmly resolved that once I return to Bangalore, I must fulfill every promise made in this Covenant.

90
00:11:32,000 --> 00:11:39,999
When the doctor who initially diagnosed me with blood cancer heard this glorious news, he immediately sent a message to all the doctors there,

91
00:11:40,000 --> 00:11:45,999
stating, "This is an absolute miracle! Otherwise, this is a disease that can never be cured."

92
00:11:46,000 --> 00:11:51,999
In this magnificent way, the Blessed Mother helped me immensely, and I have always been committed to practicing Works of Mercy.

93
00:11:52,000 --> 00:11:58,999
Whoever asks me for help, I assist them generously. Currently, there is a place nearby where they feed about 300 people;

94
00:11:59,000 --> 00:12:06,999
I joyfully sponsored the money for one day's meals there. I also instructed my son, "I don't need to know how much your salary is,

95
00:12:07,000 --> 00:12:14,999
but every year, you must faithfully calculate your Tithe and hand it over to me; that is strictly mandatory for our family."

96
00:12:15,000 --> 00:12:20,999
Every year, he calculates it and says, "Daddy, this is the Tithe amount." Then, my wife, my son, and I sit together and discern exactly where these charitable funds should be distributed,

97
00:12:21,000 --> 00:12:25,999
which is a sacred commitment we honor every single year.

98
00:12:26,000 --> 00:12:32,999
Similarly, whoever comes seeking assistance, I will unconditionally help them, whether they are Hindu, Muslim, or Christian.

99
00:12:33,000 --> 00:12:39,999
I do not discriminate at all; there is only one earthly thing in life that I do not love or cling to, and that is wealth.

100
00:12:40,000 --> 00:12:50,999
I have absolutely no reluctance in spending it, and I have never disappointed a single soul who has asked me for help. This is my heartfelt testimony.

101
00:12:51,000 --> 00:13:01,999
Regarding the Covenant of the Blessed Mother. Now, I would like to testify about another profound healing I received after making my Covenant here.

102
00:13:02,000 --> 00:13:08,999
All the fingers of my right hand were in a state of severe numbness, to the point where I couldn't even open a simple flask.

103
00:13:09,000 --> 00:13:16,999
I have a cow, and I reached a state where I couldn't even milk it. It was then, after taking this Covenant, that I applied the Blessed Mother's Holy Oil,

104
00:13:17,000 --> 00:13:22,999
set a specific date, and prayed: "Mother, please heal this affliction within 30 days, and I will boldly testify to your grace."

105
00:13:23,000 --> 00:13:28,999
Being entirely unable to milk the cow was a tremendous physical and emotional hardship for me.

106
00:13:29,000 --> 00:13:32,999
The same went for not being able to open a flask, so I interceded fervently, and within those 30 days,

107
00:13:33,000 --> 00:13:38,999
on the sixth day itself, the numbness in my hand miraculously and completely vanished!

108
00:13:39,000 --> 00:13:43,999
It has been almost a year since it healed, and I can now easily milk the cow, cut grass, and do all my chores.

109
00:13:44,000 --> 00:13:51,999
In Ayurveda, this condition is known as 'Sthambham,' a type of rheumatic disease, but the Blessed Mother healed it completely.

110
00:13:52,000 --> 00:13:58,999
Furthermore, the Blessed Mother delivered me from chronic constipation that I had painfully suffered from for many long years.

111
00:13:59,000 --> 00:14:05,999
Also, a land conversion process that I had been striving to resolve for a very long time was miraculously accomplished through her intercession.

112
00:14:06,000 --> 00:14:14,999
One day, during Father's 'Daily Bread' prayer, Father prophetically proclaimed that for those desiring to convert their land status,

113
00:14:15,000 --> 00:14:21,999
the Blessed Mother was powerfully intervening for them. Just like that, the land conversion issue was successfully and swiftly completed.

114
00:14:22,000 --> 00:14:29,999
The Blessed Mother has showered countless blessings, both big and small, upon me over the past year and a half.

115
00:14:30,000 --> 00:14:44,999
Regarding my Apostolic Works, I passionately distribute the Blessed Mother's paper, the Kreupasanam Marian paper, in 11 Indian languages and 4 foreign languages.

116
00:14:45,000 --> 00:14:52,999
We have a fellowship where we provide food for about 150 sick, bedridden patients, from Sunday to Thursday.

117
00:14:53,000 --> 00:14:59,999
It operates as a part of our fellowship's ministry, providing free lunches.

118
00:15:00,000 --> 00:15:04,999
In addition to that, we identify deserving poor families,

119
00:15:05,000 --> 00:15:12,999
buy their necessary grocery rations for a month, and deliver them to their homes. When visiting the sick in the hospital,

120
00:15:13,000 --> 00:15:17,999
if they do not have the money to buy medicine, we arrange it through our fellowship; whatever I can give from my own pocket,

121
00:15:18,000 --> 00:15:22,999
I do, and for the rest, I share it with the fellowship, collect it from them, and deliver the medicine to those in need.

122
00:15:23,000 --> 00:15:28,999
As a fellowship, we visit destitute homes, bathe the inmates there,

123
00:15:29,000 --> 00:15:35,999
cut their nails, trim their hair, clean their bathrooms, and engage in all such acts of humble service.

124
00:15:36,000 --> 00:15:40,999
When my brother-in-law was admitted here at St. John's Medical College, we had just departed from here.

125
00:15:41,000 --> 00:15:46,999
We had only left on the 11th, and my brother-in-law was admitted the very next day. The surrounding area in Bangalore is a place where five or six languages are spoken.

126
00:15:47,000 --> 00:15:55,999
We had taken the Kreupasanam paper in six languages from here, and while my brother-in-law was lying inside the hospital,

127
00:15:56,000 --> 00:16:01,999
I walked outside, found people speaking various languages, and distributed the papers to them.

128
00:16:02,000 --> 00:16:07,999
That was one mission we were able to accomplish. Furthermore,

129
00:16:08,000 --> 00:16:14,999
three or four times every month, working among non-Christians from Unnathi in Wayanad,

130
00:16:15,000 --> 00:16:22,999
we bring no less than 30 to 40 people to our Blessed Mother every month. Along with them, many come to renew their Covenant.

131
00:16:23,000 --> 00:16:30,999
However, many of them say, "We have been coming for a year, two years, three years, but our prayer intentions have not been answered."

132
00:16:31,000 --> 00:16:36,999
When we inquire, we realize they haven't understood how to do the small, simple things that our Mother desires of them.

133
00:16:37,000 --> 00:16:43,999
Thus, the Blessed Mother has profoundly used us to deepen the faith of those who have taken the Covenant.

134
00:16:44,000 --> 00:16:49,999
After that, they experienced tremendous spiritual blessings, and many of them have come here and testified. Last month,

135
00:16:50,000 --> 00:16:58,999
a sister named Prema from an Adivasi community, who suffered from severe psoriasis, was miraculously healed within eight days.

136
00:16:59,000 --> 00:17:03,999
She testified here about her healing. Similarly, many who have come here from our fellowship,

137
00:17:04,000 --> 00:17:08,999
have given their moving testimonies here, and many have been able to take the Covenant.

138
00:17:09,000 --> 00:17:14,999
The Blessed Mother continues to use us to work together as a fellowship.

139
00:17:15,000 --> 00:17:20,999
Expressing millions of thanks to the Blessed Mother and the Holy Son for all these blessings, I submit this testimony,

140
00:17:21,000 --> 00:17:29,999
before the face of the Blessed Mother. The Gospel of St. John, chapter 4, verses 52 and 53,

141
00:17:30,000 --> 00:17:38,999
So he asked them the hour when he began to mend, and they said to him, 'Yesterday at the seventh hour the fever left him.'

142
00:17:39,000 --> 00:17:45,999
The father knew that was the hour when Jesus had said to him, 'Your son will live';

143
00:17:46,000 --> 00:17:57,999
and he himself believed, and all his household." Martin and Joseph, two brothers-in-law, have come to the altar today to testify.

144
00:17:58,000 --> 00:18:04,999
As we read in the Psalms, "Behold, how good and pleasant it is when brothers dwell in unity!"

145
00:18:05,000 --> 00:18:13,999
It provides the analogy, comparing it to the precious oil running down upon the beard of Aaron, running down on the collar of his robes.

146
00:18:14,000 --> 00:18:21,999
We are witnessing a beautiful situation here where brothers are fervently praying for one another.

147
00:18:22,000 --> 00:18:28,999
Martin took the Covenant for his brother-in-law, Joseph, and following that, Joseph himself,

148
00:18:29,000 --> 00:18:36,999
came here, took the Covenant, and prayed. This is a magnificent testimony of immediate deliverance,

149
00:18:37,000 --> 00:18:43,999
a miraculous healing from blood cancer. Reverend Father Joseph often reminds us,

150
00:18:44,000 --> 00:18:50,999
of the reasons why our Covenants or prayer intentions are sometimes delayed.

151
00:18:51,000 --> 00:18:58,999
The answer to all that is what they are proclaiming to us today through this powerful testimony. Jesus says that the first will be last,

152
00:18:59,000 --> 00:19:07,999
and the last will be first; we are living in an era and a spiritual sphere where this order of life is unfolding.

153
00:19:08,000 --> 00:19:14,999
Brother Martin was acknowledging here that their spiritual investment was truly that immense.

154
00:19:15,000 --> 00:19:25,999
Respected Joseph sir shared, "I have strictly taught my son that, you must give to God the exact tithe of your annual salary."

155
00:19:26,000 --> 00:19:31,999
Just as Jesus teaches us that we must render to God the things that are God's, and to the government the things that are the government's,

156
00:19:32,000 --> 00:19:37,999
Jesus Himself teaches us this vital necessity. By teaching his son in this way, in that guiding light,

157
00:19:38,000 --> 00:19:42,999
he precisely structured his way of life and his Christian journey.

158
00:19:43,000 --> 00:19:48,999
Because the spiritual investment of structuring his life and deepening his love for Jesus was already deposited,

159
00:19:49,000 --> 00:19:53,999
we can understand that it was not at all difficult for Jesus to pour out His abundant blessings upon them.

160
00:19:54,000 --> 00:20:01,999
Through this, we also understand why God grants sudden blessings to some,

161
00:20:02,000 --> 00:20:08,999
while others are delayed, as Father constantly reminds us. No matter how grave the illnesses are,

162
00:20:09,000 --> 00:20:17,999
respected Joseph sir was diagnosed with Type 3 typhoid, and when the diagnosis subsequently revealed it was blood cancer,

163
00:20:18,000 --> 00:20:25,999
he did not falter at all. While everyone was laying hands on his head and blessing him, preparing him for a peaceful death,

164
00:20:26,000 --> 00:20:32,999
he miraculously received his healing in a mere gap of four days. This is what he is testifying today.

165
00:20:33,000 --> 00:20:41,999
Let us give thanks to Jesus and the Blessed Mother. All the testimonies we hear these days are profound testimonies of life-and-death struggles.

166
00:20:42,000 --> 00:20:48,999
We just saw a testimony recently of a brother whose legs were tied together. Similarly, testimonies of those whose eyes were closed with cotton,

167
00:20:49,000 --> 00:20:53,999
and who were declared medically dead, are being witnessed by us during these Grace-filled days.

168
00:20:54,000 --> 00:20:58,999
Let us offer all our sorrows to Jesus through the powerful intercession of the Blessed Mother.

169
00:20:59,000 --> 00:21:03,999
Giving thanks for all the blessings received by Martin and Joseph, let us offer this testimony with a resounding round of applause.

170
00:21:04,000 --> 00:21:15,999
Extraordinary experiences of God can now be yours too. If you haven't subscribed to this YouTube channel, subscribe right now.

171
00:21:16,000 --> 00:21:20,000
Share this video with your friends right now, and become missionaries of the Lord.
